# Data & admin

- ORM: Drizzle su Postgres (`DATABASE_URL` / `POSTGRES_URL`) — 4 tabelle (`users`, `members`, `events`, `albums`), volume tipico ≪ free tier
- Schema tipico: `events` (i18n + `flyerUrl` Blob), `albums` (i18n + `releaseType` album|single + `coverUrl`/`coverBackUrl`/`discUrl` Blob + link piattaforme), `members`, `users` admin
- Auth: cookie httpOnly firmato (`AUTH_SECRET`) + user in tabella `users` (o env bootstrap)
- Upload media: `@vercel/blob` (`BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN`) — volantini eventi, cover/disco album e simili
- Form contatti: Resend + honeypot + rate limit base
- Mai loggare secret, hash password o connection string
- Comandi: `npm run db:generate` · `db:push` · `db:migrate` · `db:seed` · `db:studio`
